damaged_code:
```rust
loop {
    match connect_to_database("invalid_password") {
        Ok(conn) => break conn,
        Err(_) => continue, // Retries permanent failure immediately
    }
}
```

fix:
Only retry on transient errors (like timeouts), use capped exponential backoff, and set a strict maximum retry count.
```rust
let mut retries = 0;
loop {
    match connect_to_database("password") {
        Ok(conn) => break Ok(conn),
        Err(e) if e.is_transient() && retries < 5 => {
            sleep(exponential_delay(retries));
            retries += 1;
        }
        Err(e) => break Err(e),
    }
}
```
